    <pubDate>Mon, 03 Feb 2025 12:53:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【主播】段sir</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】Chorin</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】初恋——回春丹</span></p><span></span><p><span>【录制地】广州花城汇某处</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.来到广东第一顿，阿强家川菜馆真不错</span></p><span></span><p><span>2.Chorin三字评价粤菜：鲜、全、正</span></p><span></span><p><span>3.我们在佛山金融城万达吃麦当劳的日子</span></p><span></span><p><span>4.几百块坐拥均价10几万的市中心房产使用权</span></p><span></span><p><span>5.北京路好吃的菠萝包，前提是先走20分钟的路</span></p><span></span><p><span>6.佛山祖庙黄飞鸿馆，十三姨居然是虚构人物</span></p><span></span><p><span>7.Chorin的购物原则：来都来了，1500块拿捏！</span></p><span></span><p><span>8.一月份广州街道上的桂花香飘进灵魂的时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span>一大波图片来袭</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltIW7VUaUdy5p7FPbthOpSmsZfzX.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmwH33NSWFgZDtsaulwUwjwrM34Y.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhcDCg86AMSZz8ijg_nj_kY2mzEu.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhn-jHN8lhIhssSZc0qreBFkqFx-.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkfuy6nVhG4zi7_oIzF5_9ZWrv-6.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loJvH1XgU8SkJ5G-V9SILSMXB9k_.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lur6OuIeRb_UDxc4LAP2pcIgMyEM.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk3JrvQxXVAwl9ORZKDT0ILV9mEb.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqpppogMhOBrUDhK_y_CbsA0nYNW.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
